i ha sempre voluto bene. A volte basta poco per ricominciare e questo film ce lo insegna, attraverso un racconto caldo e appassionante di rinascita."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Ten Minutes","overview":"Ten minutes a day can change the course of your day. Ten minutes doing something completely new can change the course of a life. This is what Bianca will discover in the midst of an existential crisis. New meetings, the discovery of special bonds and listening to those who have always loved us. Sometimes it doesn't take much to start over and this film teaches us this, through a warm and passionate story of rebirth."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/swRSFUjrHBTAdpy9DKFzk0NtC7e.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mb1z779Ng0LpBzNmDVrvr8fSXJM.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1083103,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/swRSFUjrHBTAdpy9DKFzk0NtC7e.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/swRSFUjrHBTAdpy9DKFzk0NtC7e.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/swRSFUjrHBTAdpy9DKFzk0NtC7e.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/swRSFUjrHBTAdpy9DKFzk0NtC7e.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]}},"background":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mb1z779Ng0LpBzNmDVrvr8fSXJM.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mb1z779Ng0LpBzNmDVrvr8fSXJM.jpg","language":"xx","width":3840,"height":2160},"candidates":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/origin